  "reproducedProductFixes": [
    "Delayed initial-save notifications now use the latest durable state; a held second startup callback cannot replace the first saved partial reply.",
    "Original comparison provider/model now come from the original reply invocation, after changing both connection and model during actual continuation and backup/restart.",
    "Durable streamed checkpoints notify each message after parallel-start snapshots; comparison creation no longer reloads whole renderer state.",
    "The comparison composer entry preserves the existing exact 32-pixel send-button size."
  ],
