  "delayedSnapshotRegressionReproduced": true,
  "scope": "The delayed startup callback regression is proven locally; the original hosted 90c cause remains unestablished. Committed source, exact 594-test coverage log and 194-check complete development desktop with normal close. Six comparison checks use eleven real isolated HTTP requests, held simultaneous streams, actual service failure and selective stop, real filesystem EIO/retry, selected continuation, independent drafts, actual JSON/gzip restore and normal restart. All nine current complete-run captures were individually inspected, and original provider/model identity remains fixed after actual continuation switches to the other connection/model and after backup/restart. Live cloud model quality and physical native dialogs remain separate; distribution and hosted completion are not claimed."
